  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Solomon began to build the house of the LORD at Jerusalem in mount Moriah, where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the LORD",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to David his father, in the place that David had prepared in the threshing-floor of Ornan the Jebusite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he began to build in the second ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the second month, in the fourth year of his reign.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are the things in which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Solomon was instructed for the building of the house of God. The length by cubits after the first measure ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sixty cubits, and the breadth twenty cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the porch that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the front ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the house",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the length ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to the breadth of the house, twenty cubits, and the hight ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred and twenty: and he overlaid it within with pure gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the greater house he cieled with fir tree, which he overlaid with fine gold, and set on it palm trees and chains.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he garnished the house with precious stones for beauty: and the gold ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " gold of Parvaim.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He overlaid also the house, the beams, the posts, and the walls of it, and the doors of it, with gold; and engraved cherubim on the walls.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the most holy house, the length of which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " according to the breadth of the house, twenty cubits, and the breadth of it twenty cubits: and he overlaid it with fine gold, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "amounting",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to six hundred talents.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the weight of the nails ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fifty shekels of gold. And he overlaid the upper chambers with gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in the most holy house he made two cherubim of image work, and overlaid them with gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the wings of the cherubim ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " twenty cubits long: one wing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the one cherub was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits, reaching to the wall of the house: and the other wing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was likewise",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits, reaching to the wing of the other cherub.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wing of the other cherub ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits, reaching to the wall of the house: and the other wing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "also",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", joining to the wing of the other cherub.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wings of these cherubim spread themselves forth twenty cubits: and they stood on their feet, and their faces ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " inward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made the vail ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blue, and purple, and crimson, and fine linen, and wrought cherubim upon it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also he made before the house two pillars of thirty and five cubits high, and the capital that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the top of each of them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CH.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CH.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he made chains, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the oracle, and put them on the heads of the pillars; and made a hundred pomegranates, and put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the chains.",
